  "collectionNotes": [
    "Specification and pin-map rows preserve factual parameters from the exact documented product, not sibling SKUs.",
    "Raw full official page/PDF downloads stay temporary; images and manufacturer CAD retain distinct rights.",
    "Model import does not establish CPU/board/peripheral firmware support.",
    "Runtime sources pinned separately; existing manufacturer CAD and original source history retained. V1.0 schematic does not establish the user’s hardware revision.",
    "Simulation scope: papers3 uses ET047TC1 black/white digital output, GT911 single contact and explicit BMI270 virtual samples. SPI SDHC TF now supports FAT32 mounting, multi-sector file writes/reads and browser persistence; RTC, audio, PMS150G power and RF are absent; full limitations and actual outputs are retained in docs/platform/papers3-runtime.md."
  ]
